<main class="rubusoo-page inquiry-page"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Import inquiry</p><h1>Turn a messy request into a confirmed quote.</h1><p>Paste an email or chat. Rubusoo extracts requirements—not prices. Every commercial amount still needs your confirmation.</p></header><%= form_with model: @inquiry, class: "inquiry-split" do |f| %><section><label class="field-label">Source type</label><%= f.select :source_type, %w[email chat text manual], {}, class: "input" %><label class="field-label">Original inquiry</label><%= f.text_area :source_text, rows: 18, required: true, placeholder: "Paste the buyer's message here…", class: "textarea textarea--source" %></section><aside class="inquiry-guidance"><h2>What happens next</h2><ol><li>Extract buyer and product requirements</li><li>Flag missing or conflicting details</li><li>Match possible Catalog items</li><li>Confirm prices and freight manually</li></ol><%= f.submit "Review extracted requirements", class: "button button--primary" %></aside><% end %></main>
